      "content": "but it doesnt feel like growth. it just feels heavy. like no matter what i do now, it doesnt change the fact that i'm just an observer. someone who just lets things happen. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back. i feel like i'm just taking up space that someone actually decent could have used.",
