    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "actions don't fix something that's rotten at the core though. it's not just a mistake, it's who i am. i just feel like my existence is a net negative for everyone else. like the world would actually be a lighter, better place if i just wasn't in it anymore. do you think some people are just born with that kind of darkness?",
